
== §1/§5 — THE SPEC AND THE NON-NEGOTIABLE RULE ==
  ✓ external BIM is never model truth
  ✓ no direct import write is allowed
  ✓ an explicit commit is required
  ✓ commits route through the authoring path
  ✓ no remote dependency is declared
  ✓ the import pipeline ends at the canonical model through authoring
  ✓ all five support levels are declared
  ✓ every declared entity carries a support level
  ✓ every required issue code is declared
  ✓ every tolerance is declared centrally and is tight
  ✓ every resource limit is finite and positive
  ✓ the four verification classes are declared
  ✓ a round trip is explicitly not interoperability verification
  ✓ the panel forbids a replace-model control
  ✓ the hard stop boundaries name the excluded integrations

